fields.value:
{{Morphnotes
| name = Celestial Hammer
| desc = The hammer returns to the caster upon losing the ability.
}}
{{Stealnotes
| name = Celestial Hammer
| desc = The hammer returns to the caster upon losing the acquired ability.
}}


* [[File:Dota2 Dawnbreaker Celestial Hammer Properties icon.png|42px|Dawnbreaker's Hammer, Brightmaul|link=#Celestial Hammer]] {{to}} {{Symbol|Target|PointArea}}
** Has a {{#var:Celestial Hammer basic1}} ({{Symbol|bonus t4l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{Show|T|Dawnbreaker|v4l}}|v1={{#var:Celestial Hammer basic1}}}}|25tal}})-{{M|projectile speed}} until reaching the point-targeted location.
** Has a max {{calc|v1/{{#var:Celestial Hammer basic1}} round2|v1={{#var:Celestial Hammer value1}}}}-second travel duration to reach max distance.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*** {{Symbol|Trees}}
**** [[Trees]] within {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#var:Celestial Hammer value2}}-radius centered around it are destroyed.
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**** Deals {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} to all enemy units within the damage radius while traveling.
**** Can affect the same enemy twice, once while traveling to its destination, and once while returning.
*** The return speed is defined as:
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|HammerReturnSpeed {{=}} ProjectileSpeed OR 1.5s}}

* [[File:Dota2 Dawnbreaker Converge Properties icon.png|42px|Dawnbreaker's Hammer, Brightmaul|link=#Celestial Hammer]] While Celestial Hammer is active:
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** Brightmaul returns upon casting {{A|Dawnbreaker|Solar Guardian}}.
*** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
**** Grants a 1-second {{#var:Celestial Hammer value2}}-radius [[flying vision]] centered around Brightmaul upon reaching the {{Symbol|Target|PointArea}} point-targeted location.
*** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
**** Uses a different [[attack animation]] while Brightmaul is at the point-targeted location.
**** This neither {{M|disarms}} nor changes Dawnbreaker's attack properties.

* [[File:Dota2 Dawnbreaker Celestial Hammer Recall icon.png|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Dawnbreaker Celestial Hammer Properties icon.png|42px|Dawnbreaker's Hammer, Brightmaul|link=#Celestial Hammer]]
** Brightmaul returns when Dawnbreaker has {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|celestial_hammer_caster}} active.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*** Creates 13 {{#var:Celestial Hammer type1 value4}}-second {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#var:Celestial Hammer type1 value1}}-radius fire trail cells along the return path as Brightmaul returns.
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**** {{Symbol|Target|Area-Dummy}} {{Symbol|Aura}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|dawnbreaker_converge}}
***** Each created cell has its own independent duration, and provides a negative [[aura]] that applies the debuff on affected enemy units within its radius.
***** Hence the first created cell disappears earlier than the last created fire cell at the end location.
**** Deals {{calc|v1*{{#var:Celestial Hammer basic2}}|v1={{#var:Celestial Hammer type1 value2}}}} {{M|magical|x}} {{M|spell damage|x}} in {{#var:Celestial Hammer basic2}}-second intervals, immediately upon debuff application, over {{calc|(v1+{{#var:Celestial Hammer type1 value5}})/{{#var:Celestial Hammer basic2}}+1|v1={{#var:Celestial Hammer type1 value4}}}} instances.
**** Multiple overlapping fire cell radius do not stack.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Celestial Hammer icon0}}
| desc = Dawnbreaker hurls her weapon at a target, damaging enemies struck along the way. The hammer pauses for 2 seconds at the destination before flying back to her, leaving a trail of fire that slows enemies. Dawnbreaker can recall the hammer at any time, pulling her towards it so they meet in the middle.
}}
* {{Symbol|fx|v}} [[File:Dota2 Dawnbreaker Celestial Hammer Recall icon.png|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Dawnbreaker Celestial Hammer Properties icon.png|42px|Dawnbreaker's Hammer, Brightmaul|link=#Celestial Hammer]]
** The hammer disappears after its pause duration upon Dawnbreaker's {{M|death}}.

* Deals up to {{calc|v1*{{#var:Celestial Hammer basic2}}*((v2+{{#var:Celestial Hammer type1 value5}})/{{#var:Celestial Hammer basic2}}+1)|v1={{#var:Celestial Hammer type1 value2}}|v2={{#var:Celestial Hammer type1 value4}}}} {{M|magical|x}} {{M|spell damage|x}} ([[before reductions]]) within the radius, over {{calc|(v1+{{#var:Celestial Hammer type1 value5}})/{{#var:Celestial Hammer basic2}}+1|v1={{#var:Celestial Hammer type1 value4}}}} damage instances with the {{M|aura}} linger duration.

