 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Luminosity icon0}}
| desc = After a number of attacks, Dawnbreaker powers up, charging her next attack with a critical hit that heals all allied heroes within 650 units around her for a portion of attack damage dealt. Creeps and neutral enemies provide less healing. Allies are healed for 50% of the amount.
}}
* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
