** The tally counter becomes bright green at {{Symbol|Tally|3}}, and the utilizes the {{Code|attack_buff}} modifier.

* When attacking creeps, Dawnbreaker {{M|lifesteals}} for {{calc|v1*v2|v1={{#var:Luminosity type2 value1}}|v2={{#var:Luminosity type1 value1}}|%}} of the powered-up attack ([[after reductions]]).

