fields.value:
{{Debuffnotes
| name = Solar Guardian
| desc = The landing {{M|stun}} component affects [[debuff immune]] enemy units.<br><br>All {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} components applied explicitly do not interact with {{M|magic resistance}} granted by debuff immune sources.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Solar Guardian icon0}}
| desc = CHANNELED - Dawnbreaker creates a pulsing effect at a location within 350 units of an allied hero anywhere on the map and creates daylight for 6s. Each pulse damages enemies and heals allies.<br><br>After a short duration, she flies to the target location and deals additional damage and stuns enemies upon landing.<br><br>Once channeled, Dawnbreaker cannot stop the ability.
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|Channeling}}
** Dawnbreaker cannot manually cancel the [[channeling]] for the following reasons:
*** She is unable to move while channeling and during its flight duration.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
** {{M|Heals}} up to {{calc|v1*{{#var:Solar Guardian value5}}|v1={{#var:Solar Guardian value3}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*({{#var:Solar Guardian value5}}+{{#var:Solar Guardian type4 value2 agh}})|v1={{#var:Solar Guardian value3}}}}|agh}}) health for the entire duration.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Deals up to {{calc|v1*{{#var:Solar Guardian value5}}|v1={{#var:Solar Guardian value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*({{#var:Solar Guardian value5}}+{{#var:Solar Guardian type4 value2 agh}})|v1={{#var:Solar Guardian value2}}}}|agh}}) damage ([[before reductions]]) for the entire duration.
** The ability effects are applied as follows:
**# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
**# The {{Symbol|Stun}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|modifier_stunned}}.

* {{Symbol|Illusions}} {{to}} {{Symbol|fx|v}} 
** The more the Dawnbreaker-based [[illusion]], the brighter the {{Symbol|Target|Area}} area-targeting reticule.

